# fpm build/install artifacts
/_build_fpm/
/_install_fpm/

# meson build/install artifacts, and everything its wrap fetches fresh from
# GitHub every time -- mctc-lib itself and, promoted up by Meson, its own
# subprojects (jonquil, toml-f) and their .wrap files. Only the wrap file
# this directory authors itself, subprojects/mctc-lib.wrap, is tracked.
/_build_meson/
/_install_meson/
/subprojects/*
!/subprojects/mctc-lib.wrap
